    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29039" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠσ-ήνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡνία</span>) = foreg., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>refractory</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epict.
				<u>Gnom.</u>
				63
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ δυσήνιόν ἐστι</span>
			 (v.l. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άνιόν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				803
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>B.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνία</span>) 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσάνιος</span>
			, <i>ill at ease, uneasy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιά</span> codd. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠσ-ηνῐόχητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>hard to hold in, ungovernable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Abd.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
